<sheet>
<description>POWER INPUT</description>
<plain>
<wire x1="6.35" y1="113.03" x2="381" y2="113.03" width="0.1524" layer="94"/>
<text x="7.62" y="248.92" size="3.81" layer="97">eFUSE</text>
<text x="175.26" y="49.53" size="1.778" layer="97">LM5060 configured for 24–48 V input range.





VDS current limit set to ~8 A using RS = 7.15 kΩ.

Calculation assumes BSC070N10NS3G MOSFET with ~11 mΩ hot RDS(on):
VDSTH = RS × 16 µA − 25 mV.

UVLO Turn-On 18.15 V
UVLO Turn-Off 15.51 V
OVP Shutdown (Trigger) 58.00 V 
OVP Recovery 51.04 V
</text>
<text x="303.53" y="156.21" size="1.778" layer="97">opto on if power is GOOD</text>
<text x="303.53" y="88.9" size="3.81" layer="97">POWER LED</text>
<text x="6.35" y="106.68" size="3.81" layer="97">PASS THROUGH POWER</text>
</plain>
